            ("What is the highest mountain peak on planet Earth above sea level, situated in the Himalayas?", "Mount Everest (Sagarmatha / Chomolungma)", ["K2 (Mount Godwin-Austen)", "Kangchenjunga", "Lhotse"], "Mount Everest stands at an official elevation of 8,848.86 meters (29,031.7 feet) on the Nepal-Tibet border."),
