            ("What is the largest river in the world by water discharge volume, carrying more water than the next seven largest rivers combined?", "The Amazon River", ["The Congo River", "The Ganges River", "The Mississippi River"], "The Amazon accounts for roughly 20% of the total global river flow entering oceans worldwide."),
