            ("What is the smallest independent sovereign nation-state in the world by both land area and population?", "Vatican City State", ["Monaco", "Nauru", "San Marino"], "Encircled by Rome, Italy, Vatican City encompasses just 0.19 square miles (49 hectares)."),
            ("What is the second-smallest independent nation in the world, famous for its Monte Carlo district on the French Riviera?", "Monaco", ["Liechtenstein", "San Marino", "Andorra"], "Monaco covers approximately 0.78 square miles with the highest population density of any sovereign state."),
            ("What is the most populous landlocked country in the world, located in the Horn of Africa?", "Ethiopia", ["Uganda", "Bolivia", "Kazakhstan"], "With over 120 million inhabitants, Ethiopia is the world\'s most populous nation without coastline access."),
