            ("What is the largest enclosed inland body of water on Earth by surface area, frequently classified as an inland sea?", "The Caspian Sea", ["The Aral Sea", "The Black Sea", "The Red Sea"], "The endorheic Caspian Sea spans 143,000 square miles, bounded by Russia, Kazakhstan, Turkmenistan, Iran, and Azerbaijan."),
            ("What is the world\'s tallest uninterrupted waterfall, dropping 3,212 feet from Auyantepui mountain in Venezuela?", "Angel Falls (Salto Angel)", ["Tugela Falls", "Victoria Falls", "Niagara Falls"], "Angel Falls drops 979 meters in Canaima National Park, named after American aviator Jimmie Angel."),
            ("What magnificent waterfall on the Zambezi River between Zambia and Zimbabwe is known locally as 'Mosi-oa-Tunya' ('The Smoke That Thunders')?", "Victoria Falls", ["Angel Falls", "Iguazu Falls", "Niagara Falls"], "Victoria Falls forms the largest sheet of falling water in the world, measuring 5,604 feet wide and 354 feet high."),
            ("What massive semicircular system of 275 waterfalls straddles the border between Argentina and Brazil?", "Iguazu Falls", ["Victoria Falls", "Angel Falls", "Kaieteur Falls"], "Surrounded by lush subtropical rainforest, Iguazu Falls features the spectacular U-shaped 'Devil\'s Throat' chasm."),
